# Player.events — smoke-test sheet for the bridge (Task 3 Part C/D verify).
# An actor named Player suffices: WASD walks at 40, holding Shift while pressing W sprints at 70.
# The `unless` line is a gate: while Shift is down, the walk move is skipped, and the sprint
# event (which only runs while W is held too) pushes the faster step instead.
# Left Mouse / Right Mouse / Middle Mouse and other named keys work the same way.

when game starts
  set WalkHint to "walk with WASD, hold Shift with W to sprint"

when W is held
  unless Left Shift is held
  move forward speed 40

when Left Shift is held
  W is held
  move forward speed 70

when A is held
  move left speed 40

when D is held
  move right speed 40

when S is held
  move backward speed 40

when Space is pressed
  add 1 to Hops

when Hops becomes 3
  set text of HopsLabel to "three hops!"
